2319	 * Real incident, 2026-07-25 (and this had happened BEFORE — it is field note #13,
2320	 * documented after a previous migration and it recurred anyway, which is exactly
2321	 * why it is now an executable pre-flight instead of a paragraph in a document):
2322	 *
2323	 *     nexis-next.service
2324	 *       ExecStart=/usr/local/bin/node /opt/nexis/node_modules/next/dist/bin/next start -p 3105
2325	 *
2326	 * The source had a hand-installed Node at /usr/local/bin/node. The target has
2327	 * apt's Node 20 at /usr/bin/node and NOTHING at /usr/local/bin/node, so systemd
2328	 * failed the exec with status 203/EXEC. The unit crash-looped 78 times and the
2329	 * migration reported SUCCESS.
