16	/**
17	 * VPS migration — pull a customer's files + databases from another provider's
18	 * VPS onto their new Nxeon server. The customer supplies SSH credentials for the
19	 * SOURCE box; we only ever verify ownership of the TARGET (Nxeon) server.
20	 *
21	 * All source secrets (the SSH password and each database password) are encrypted
22	 * at rest with the shared AES-256-GCM box in lib/crypto-box.ts (`encryptSecret`),
23	 * the SAME helper used for mailbox/BYOK secrets. They are CLEARED by the worker
24	 * (worker/migrate.ts) the moment the migration finishes — success or failure —
25	 * so a completed Migration row never retains usable credentials. Nothing here
26	 * ever returns a decrypted secret (or the ciphertext) to the client.
